  <metadata>
    <name>Gusinje – Velji vrh</name>
    <desc>The trail of 6.6 km leads from Gusinje to the summit of Velji vrh (2196 m a.s.l.) with a total ascent of 1263 m. It is demanding and intended for experienced hikers seeking a true high-mountain challenge. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
